\newlabel{fig:heap}{{4.5}{44}{A max-heap drawn as a tree (left) and stored as an array (right). The tree is complete, so the array has no gaps, and no pointers are needed: the parent of index $i$ is $\lfloor (i - 1)/2 \rfloor $}{figure.caption.71}{}}
